abstract: >-
  Intent-Driven Quality Assurance (IDQA) is a methodological research proposal
  that connects software intent to explicit guarantees, evidence requirements,
  evidence strategies, observations and bounded assurance conclusions.
keywords:
  - software quality assurance
  - software assurance
  - intent-driven quality assurance
  - software testing
  - evidence
  - compositional assurance


